[
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p1:t0:u",
    "text": "ISBN978-4-8401-2927-5 C9979 ¥524E"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p1:t1:u",
    "text": "定価:本体524円(税別) 雑誌52648-27 メディアファクトリー"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p1:t2:u",
    "text": "IN A WORLD WHERE IT'S NORMAL FOR YOUNG BOYS AND GIRLS TO POSSESS A SPECIAL POWER KNOWN AS \"IRIS\"... Toru, A BOY WHO \"DOESN'T HAVE ANY POWER\" AND IS THEREFORE THE TARGET OF CONSTANT BULLYING, LIVED BY HIS MOTTO OF 'MINIMAL EXPOSURE' - TO LIVE WITHOUT STANDING OUT. HOWEVER, AFTER RECEIVING A CERTAIN \"CONFESSION\" FROM Koyuki, A POPULAR GIRL AT SCHOOL, HIS SUPPOSEDLY PEACEFUL SCHOOL LIFE IS SHATTERED. THUS, HIS MOTTO BEGINS TO SHAKE...! THIS IS AN EXCITING SCHOOL FANTASY STORY THAT STARTS FROM THE MEETING OF A BOY AND GIRL."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p1:t3:u",
    "text": "9784840129275"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p1:t4:u",
    "text": "1929979005245"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p1:t5:u",
    "text": "MFコミックス alive SERIES"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p1:t6:u",
    "text": "蛍たかな +ピロ式 Hotarutakana + Piroshiki"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p1:t7:u",
    "text": "FACTORY"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p2:t0:u",
    "text": "IN CLASS 2-6 WITH Asahi AND Hijiri"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p2:t1:u",
    "text": "Koyuki Sasamori"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p2:t2:u",
    "text": "HER IRIS ALLOWS HER TO SEE QUALIFIED PEOPLE. WHETHER A PERSON IS QUALIFIED OR NOT IS INDICATED BY AN O OR X ABOVE THEIR HEAD. AS FOR WHAT A PERSON IS QUALIFIED FOR, THAT IS DETERMINED BY WHAT Koyuki IS THINKING OF AT THAT MOMENT."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p2:t3:u",
    "text": "IN CHAPTER 1, WHILE ELECTING A PRESIDENT, THE REASON SHE ONLY LOOKED AT STUDENTS WAS BECAUSE IN ORDER TO BE QUALIFIED TO BE THE PRESIDENT IN THAT SCHOOL, YOU HAVE TO BE ONE OF THEIR STUDENTS, SO THAT CONDITION WAS ADDED IN AUTOMATICALLY. THAT'S WHY Koyuki WAS QUITE TROUBLED AFTER HAVING LOOKED AT ALMOST ALL THE STUDENTS."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p2:t4:u",
    "text": "HIS PERSONALITY IS PESSIMISTIC AND RUDE, BOTH SEEM TO HAVE BEEN BORN AS A RESULT OF BULLYING. AS ONE WOULD EXPECT, AFTER HIS EXPERIENCES FROM HIS ELEMENTARY SCHOOL YEARS, THE DEBUT OF HIS \"MINIMAL EXPOSURE\" POLICY WAS IN HIGH SCHOOL, HOWEVER, IN THE FIRST CHAPTER, THE NATURAL ENEMY OF THAT PEACEFUL SCHOOL LIFE APPEARS... BUT BECAUSE OF HIS ABILITY TO ANALYZE, NO MATTER HOW MUCH HE TRIES, HE CAN'T CUT HIMSELF FREE FROM THIS UNLUCKY QUALITY OR HIS UNFORTUNATE PAST (REFERENCE TO CH4)."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p2:t5:u",
    "text": "HE'S A NEGATIVE CHARACTER WHO YOU WOULDN'T THINK WOULD BE THE PROTAGONIST OF A SHOUNEN MANGA, AND HE WANTS TO CONTINUE DOING THINGS HIS WAY."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p2:t6:u",
    "text": "Toru Mizushima"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p3:t0:u",
    "text": "THANK YOU VERY MUCH FOR PURCHASING THIS BOOK. THIS IS MY FIRST TANKOUBON... IT WOULD MAKE ME HAPPY IF YOU FEEL EVEN THE SLIGHTEST THING AFTER READING THIS MANGA."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p3:t1:u",
    "text": "Illustration: 蜜たかみ Design: 清水大輔(designCREST)"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p4:g7:u",
    "text": "I WONDER WHEN IT STARTED, WHEN CHILDREN WERE BORN WITH A POWER CALLED \"IRIS\" IN THEIR EYES."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p4:g4:u",
    "text": "THE TYPE OF POWERS WERE VERY EXTENSIVE, \"BEING ABE SEE FORMER LIVES\", \"BEING ABE SEE WHAT'S FOR DINNER\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p4:g5:u",
    "text": "Toru, IF YOU WHY, THEY THEN WHY, THEY TRY AND \"SEE\" SOMETHING?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p4:g1:u",
    "text": "IDIOT/ IT'S IMPOSSIBLE FOR THIS GUY."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p4:g6:u",
    "text": "THIS POWER THAT ADULTS DIDN'T HAVE SPLIT THE WORLD INTO TWO: \"THOSE WHO HAVE IT\" AND \"THOSE WHO DON'T\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p4:g3:u",
    "text": "LIAR."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p4:g2:u",
    "text": "AND BEFORE WE KNEW IT, IT BECAME A CERTIFIED WAY OF CHOOSING WHO WAS TO BE ALIENATED."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p5:g1:u",
    "text": "YOU'RE JUST AN \"IRIS ZERO\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p5:t1:u",
    "text": "CHAPTER I: \"THINGS THAT CAN'T BE SEEN\""
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p6:g1:u",
    "text": "NOW THAT YOU MENTION IT, I JUST SAW SOMETHING STRANGE WITH MY IRIS."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p6:g2:u",
    "text": "EHH, REALLY?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p6:t2:u",
    "text": "A HA HA"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p8:g3:u",
    "text": "MY FAVORITE MOTTO IS \"MINIMAL EXPOSURE\"..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p8:t1:u",
    "text": "NEWSPAPER: THE BULLYING PROBLEM: \"EXTREMELY SERIOUS\""
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p8:g2:u",
    "text": "BECAUSE FOOLISHLY ATTRACTING ATTENTION JUST MAKES MORE ENEMIES."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p8:g1:u",
    "text": "...I FOUND IT..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p9:g4:u",
    "text": "THAT'S WHY I HIDE IN THE SHADOWS."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p9:g2:u",
    "text": "ITS ALREADY BECOME A PART OF ME."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p9:t2:u",
    "text": "GO CUTE!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p9:g7:u",
    "text": "EH? WHY!?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p9:t4:u",
    "text": "IT'S TRUE!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p9:g3:u",
    "text": "IT'S Sasamori-san!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p9:t6:u",
    "text": "WONDER WHY."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p9:t7:u",
    "text": "WHOAA-"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p9:g6:u",
    "text": "Koyuki-chan!? REALLY!?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p9:g1:u",
    "text": "OR IT WAS SUPPOSED TO BE..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p9:t10:u",
    "text": "4/2 3"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p9:g5:u",
    "text": "UMM..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p10:g6:u",
    "text": "UWAH!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p10:g2:u",
    "text": "EH? Sasamori-san?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p10:g3:u",
    "text": "Mizushima Toru-san..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p10:g5:u",
    "text": "!?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p10:g1:u",
    "text": "PLEASE GO OUT WITH ME!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p10:g4:u",
    "text": "!? ? ! ? ? !?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p11:g1:u",
    "text": "? ??"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p11:t2:u",
    "text": "EXPO- SURE RATE:"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p11:t3:u",
    "text": "100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p12:t0:u",
    "text": "I FEEL LIKE DYING..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p12:g4:u",
    "text": "?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p12:t2:u",
    "text": "IPANICKED AND RUSHED OUT OF THE CLASSROOM,"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p12:t3:u",
    "text": "HERE..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p12:t4:u",
    "text": "AH, THANK YOU."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p12:t5:u",
    "text": "BUT WHAT KIND OF FACE SHOULD I PLUT ON TOMORROW?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p12:g6:u",
    "text": "UMM..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p12:g1:u",
    "text": "COULD I HAVE YOUR REPLY TO WHAT I SAID EARLIER?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p12:g3:u",
    "text": "AND LOOK FOR THE NEXT STUDENT COUNCIL PRESIDENT. YES! PLEASE GO OUT WITH ME..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p12:g5:u",
    "text": "HUH?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p12:g2:u",
    "text": "HUH? YOU WERE SERIOUS?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p13:g4:u",
    "text": "MY IRIS ALLOWS ME TO SEE \"QUALIFIED PEOPLE\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p13:g1:u",
    "text": "AND DUE TO THIS, I M'FTEN GIVEN THE JOB OF DECIDING OFFICERS AND OTHER STAFF."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p13:g5:u",
    "text": "BUT THIS YEAR, I COULDN'T FIND A \"QUALIFIED PERSON\" TO BE THE STUDENT COUNCIL PRESIDENT, NO MATTER HOW MUCH I TRIED... THIS IS THE FIRST TIME THIS HAS EVER HAPPENED... SO I DECIDED I NEEDED TO FIND SOMEONE TO HELP..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p13:g3:u",
    "text": "AND THIS \"QUALIFIED PERSON\" TO DO THAT IS ME, HUH...?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p13:g6:u",
    "text": "I SEE..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p13:g2:u",
    "text": "OF COURSE I KNOW THAT TELLING YOU THIS ALL OF A SUDDEN IS A BOTHER..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p14:g1:u",
    "text": "BUT, WILL YOU HELP ME?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p14:g2:u",
    "text": "I DON'T HAVE ANYONE ELSE TO RELY ON."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p14:g5:u",
    "text": "N..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p14:g4:u",
    "text": "NO, BUT I... I'M..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p14:g3:u",
    "text": "EH...?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p15:g3:u",
    "text": "!!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p15:g2:u",
    "text": "...EH ...?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p15:g1:u",
    "text": "...! TCH!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p16:g4:u",
    "text": "EH? WH- WHY...?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p16:g1:u",
    "text": "...SORRY, BUT YOUR EXPECTATIONS WERE MISPLACED."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p16:g2:u",
    "text": "BECAUSE I DON'T HAVE AN \"IRIS\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p16:g3:u",
    "text": "...!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p17:g3:u",
    "text": "MORNING~"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p17:g2:u",
    "text": "Toru-kun!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p17:g7:u",
    "text": "YOU'RE ALL OVER THE RUMOURS! THE SAY Sasamori-chan CONFESSED TO YOU."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p17:g8:u",
    "text": "Hijiri... YOU SURE ARE HAPPY EVEN THOUGH IT'S SO EARLY IN THE MORNING..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p17:g5:u",
    "text": "HUH?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p17:g1:u",
    "text": "YOU KNOW? Sasamori Koyuki? SHE'S SWEET, CUTE, AND HAS SUCH A MODEST PERSONALITY."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p17:g6:u",
    "text": "SHE'S POPULAR ENOUGH TO RANK IN THE TOP 5 OF THE MOST POPULAR GIRLS, AND TO THINK SHE CONFESSED TO YOU."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p17:g4:u",
    "text": "HMMM. SO THAT GIRL YESTERDAY WAS Sasamori, HUH?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p17:t9:u",
    "text": "---"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p18:g4:u",
    "text": "Toru, YOU DIDN'T KNOW THAT!?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p18:t1:u",
    "text": "NO WAY~!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p18:g3:u",
    "text": "DOES IT REALLY MATTER? SHE'S GOT NOTHING TO DO WITH ME."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p18:t3:u",
    "text": "WHAT'S WRONG WITH THAT?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p18:g2:u",
    "text": "SHE CONFESSES AND IT'S GOT NOTHING TO DO WITH YOU...?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p18:g1:u",
    "text": "THAT'S NOT WHAT HAPPENED YESTERDAY. AND BE- SIDES... ...I TOLD HER ABOUT MY IRIS..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p18:g7:u",
    "text": "...I SEE. BUT, YOU WERE AT LEAST A LITTLE BIT HAPPY, RIGHT?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p18:g6:u",
    "text": "...HOW DO YOU EXPECT ME TO ANSWER THAT...?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p18:g5:u",
    "text": "AH! GOOD MORNING, Mizushima-san!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p19:g2:u",
    "text": "Isn't the weather nice?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p19:g3:u",
    "text": "!?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p19:t2:u",
    "text": "...WHY IS SHE...?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p19:t3:u",
    "text": "WHOA~"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p19:g1:u",
    "text": "...WHAT ARE YOU DOING?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p19:t5:u",
    "text": "SO MANY PEOPLE~"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p20:g1:u",
    "text": "I'M LOOKING AT THE STUDENTS COMING TO SCHOOL."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p20:g4:u",
    "text": "WHAT HAPPENED IS A SHAME, BUT I THOUGHT I'D TRY MY BEST WITH WHAT I CAN DO."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p20:t2:u",
    "text": "EHH- THEY'RE TALKING."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p20:t4:u",
    "text": "WHO'S THAT GUY?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p20:g2:u",
    "text": "...I SEE. WELL, I HOPE YOU FIND IT."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p20:g3:u",
    "text": "THANK YOU!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p21:g4:u",
    "text": "...WHAT? ISN'T THAT THE \"IRIS ZERO\"?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p21:g1:u",
    "text": "WHAT HAPPENED TO Sasamori-san? WHY IS SHE GETTING SO CLOSE TO HIM?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p21:g5:u",
    "text": "THE \"IRIS ZERO\" SNOUL JUST BE LEFT ALONE."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p21:g3:u",
    "text": "...EHH, THAT WAS A BIT OF A SHOCK."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p21:g6:u",
    "text": "YEAH."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p21:g2:u",
    "text": "...THATS RIGHT."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p22:t0:u",
    "text": "Don't get carried away!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p22:t1:u",
    "text": "Stay way from yuki-chan! you're just an Iris Zero"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p22:t2:u",
    "text": "away Koyuki You'r"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p22:g3:u",
    "text": "RAISING MY EXPOSURE RATE WILL JUST MAKE MORE ENEMIES."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p22:g4:u",
    "text": "I SHOULDN'T HANG AROUND SOMEONE WHO STANDS OUT SO MUCH.."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p22:g2:u",
    "text": "I NEED TO PROTECT MY MINIMAL EXPOSURE..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p22:g1:u",
    "text": "BY THE WAY..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p23:g1:u",
    "text": "ISN'T SHE THE FIRST ONE SINCE ME..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p23:g4:u",
    "text": "HMPH."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p23:g3:u",
    "text": "AND THE DAY AFTER THAT,"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p23:g5:u",
    "text": "SHE CONTINUED TO STAND AT THE SCHOOL GATES,"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p23:g6:u",
    "text": "GREETING ME AS IF NOTHING CHANGED."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p23:g2:u",
    "text": "WHO STILL TALKS TO YOU DESPIE KNOWING THAT YOU DON'T HAVE AN IRIS?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p23:g7:u",
    "text": "THE NEXT DAY,"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p24:t0:u",
    "text": "LIBRARY"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p24:g6:u",
    "text": "AH..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p24:g4:u",
    "text": "Mizushima-san..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p24:g3:u",
    "text": "YOU SHOULD STOP DOING THAT."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p24:g5:u",
    "text": "EH?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p24:g1:u",
    "text": "I MEAN TALKING TO ME EVERY MORNING."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p24:g2:u",
    "text": "DON'T YOU REALIZE IT'S STARTING TO DRAW ATTENTION?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p25:g3:u",
    "text": "EHH!? I DIDN'T NOTICE!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p25:g4:u",
    "text": "...THEN ALLOW ME TELL YOU."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p25:g2:u",
    "text": "WE \"TRIS ZEROS\" BEAT UP IF WE STAND OUT."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p25:g1:u",
    "text": "...STANDING OUT IS A MATTER OF LIFE AND DEATH."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p25:g5:u",
    "text": "THAT'S WHY MY POLICY IS \"MINIMAL EXPOSURE\". ...PLEASE DON'T GET IN MY WAY OF THAT..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p26:g8:u",
    "text": "And also..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p26:g7:u",
    "text": "It'll also cause problems for her if too much attention is drawn to her handing around me..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p26:g2:u",
    "text": "...I'M SORRY... I DIDN'T THINK THAT I WAS TROUBLING YOU..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p26:g4:u",
    "text": "...BUT,"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p26:g1:u",
    "text": "IT'S ONLY UNTIL TODAY, SO PLEASE DON'T WORRY ANYMORE."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p26:g5:u",
    "text": "TODAY?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p26:g3:u",
    "text": "YES, TODAY IS THE TIME LIMIT."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p26:g6:u",
    "text": "AHH..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p27:t0:u",
    "text": "I GUESS SHE DIDN'T FIND ANYONE, HUH...?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p27:g2:u",
    "text": "AFTER THIS, I AM GOING TO REPORT THAT I WAS UNABLE TO FIND A QUALIFIED PERSON. BUT..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p27:g4:u",
    "text": "I TRIED MY BEST WITH WHAT I CAN DO...!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p27:g7:u",
    "text": "WHAT SHE COULD DO..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p27:g1:u",
    "text": "...I GUESS. IT'S BETTER THAN SOMEONE LIKE ME WHO CAN'T SEE ANYTHING."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p27:g5:u",
    "text": "EH? THAT'S NOT TRUE."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p27:g6:u",
    "text": "HUH?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p27:g3:u",
    "text": "I MEAN..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p28:g4:u",
    "text": "UNLIKE US,"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p28:g1:u",
    "text": "YOU CAN SEE THE WORLD AS IT IS, WITHOUT ANY KIND OF FILTER, RIGHT?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p28:g6:u",
    "text": "1..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p28:g2:u",
    "text": "AH... I'M SORRY, I SAID SOMETHING INSENSITIVE AGAIN, DIDN'T I?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p28:g5:u",
    "text": "NO..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p28:g3:u",
    "text": "CAN SEE...?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p29:g1:u",
    "text": "BUT I REALLY WAS A LITTLE JEALOUS... WELL THEN, I NEED TO GO NOW."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p29:g2:u",
    "text": ". . . ."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p29:t3:u",
    "text": "I thought I'd try my best and do what I can do."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p29:g3:u",
    "text": "The things I can do..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p30:g7:u",
    "text": "OKAY THEN, LET'S BEGIN THE STUDENT COUNCIL PRESIDENT ELECTION MEETING."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p30:g3:u",
    "text": "ELECTION MEETING, HUH?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p30:g1:u",
    "text": "IT'S JUST Sasamori-chan BRINGING IN WHOEVER SHE \"SAW,\" THEN WE HAVE AN APPOINTMENT CEREMONY, RIGHT?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p30:g5:u",
    "text": "HEY, HE CAN HEAR YOU."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p30:g2:u",
    "text": "DON'T YOU THINK SO TOO, Yuuki?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p30:g8:u",
    "text": "IT'S STARTING"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p30:g4:u",
    "text": "OKAY THEN, PLEASE ANNOUNCE THE \"QUALIFIED PERSON\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p30:g6:u",
    "text": "Sasamori-san."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p31:g3:u",
    "text": "... Koyuki ...?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p31:g1:u",
    "text": "I'M TERRIBLY SORRY."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p31:g4:u",
    "text": "...EH? WHAT DOES SHE MEAN?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p31:g5:u",
    "text": "WHY?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p31:g2:u",
    "text": "I TRIED, BUT I COULDN'T FIND ONE..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p32:g3:u",
    "text": "...EVE THOUGH YOU STOOD AT THE SCHOOL GATES LIKE THAT EVERY DAY?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p32:g4:u",
    "text": "ARE YOU SURE THAT IT'S \"YOU COULDN'T FIND ONE,\" AND NOT \"YOU DIDN'T SEE ONE?\""
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p32:g10:u",
    "text": "!?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p32:g2:u",
    "text": "YOU'VE BEEN GETTING CLOSE TO THAT \"TRIS ZERO\" RECENTLY, HAVEN'T YOU?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p32:g5:u",
    "text": "AND \"SEEING AN O AND X ABOVE PEOPLE'S HEADS\" SEEMS RATHER FAR-FETCHED..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p32:g11:u",
    "text": "HEY ..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p32:g1:u",
    "text": "IT'S TRUE THAT I'VE SEEN HER TALKING TO THE \"IRIS ZERO\"..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p32:g8:u",
    "text": "THAT'S ... ..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p32:g7:u",
    "text": "NO WAY. REALLY?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p32:g6:u",
    "text": "Sasamori-san DID THAT?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p32:g9:u",
    "text": "DON'T TELL ME..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p33:g2:u",
    "text": "THE MOOD'S GETTING BAD..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p33:g8:u",
    "text": "... Koyuki ... ISN'T SOME- ONE WHO WOULD LIE..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p33:g3:u",
    "text": "BUT ITS ALSO TRUE THAT Sasamori-san COULDN'T FIND A QUALIFIED PERSON."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p33:g4:u",
    "text": "WHATLL YOU DO ...?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p33:g7:u",
    "text": "Sasamori-san, DON'T TELL ME..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p33:g1:u",
    "text": "YOU GOT CLOSE TO HIM BECAUSE YOU'RE ALSO AN \"TRIS ZERO\"...?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p33:g6:u",
    "text": "THAT'S .."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p33:g5:u",
    "text": "NO....!!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p33:g9:u",
    "text": "Mizushima-san JUST HELPED ME..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p34:g1:u",
    "text": "EH?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p35:g2:u",
    "text": "\"AHH ...\""
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p35:g1:u",
    "text": "\"WRONG ROOM.\""
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p35:g4:u",
    "text": "THERE'S SOMETHING THERE."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p35:g5:u",
    "text": "THE \"IRIS ZERO\"?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p35:g9:u",
    "text": "WEIRD GUY."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p35:g6:u",
    "text": "Mizushima-san..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p35:g7:u",
    "text": "WHAT'S WITH HIM?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p35:g8:u",
    "text": "WH-WHAT'S WRONG WITH... UMM... YOUR HEAD..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p35:g3:u",
    "text": "MY HEAD? OH, YEAH..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p36:g6:anchor-segment-1:u",
    "text": "\"I CAN'T BELIEVE THIS HAPPENED!\""
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p36:g6:anchor-segment-2:u",
    "text": "I DIDN'T NOTICE AT ALL..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p36:g8:u",
    "text": "?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p36:g5:u",
    "text": "I MEAN, I CAN'T SEE WHAT'S ABOVE MY OWN HEAD, RIGHT?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p36:g3:u",
    "text": "EH..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p36:g9:u",
    "text": "ABOVE ... YOUR OWN HEAD ...?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p36:g1:u",
    "text": "EH, DOESN'T THAT MEAN...?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p36:g2:u",
    "text": "AH. NOW THAT I THINK ABOUT IT..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p36:g4:u",
    "text": "Sasamori-san'S \"IRIS\"..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p37:g1:u",
    "text": "SHOWS AN O OR X..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p37:g5:u",
    "text": "ABOVE A PERSON'S HEAD..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p37:g3:u",
    "text": "EH? THEN,"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p37:g4:u",
    "text": "DOESN'T THAT MEAN..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p37:g6:u",
    "text": "THE QUALIFIED PERSON"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p37:g2:u",
    "text": "IS Sasamori-san HER- SELF...?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p37:g8:u",
    "text": "EH...?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p37:g7:u",
    "text": "EHHH !?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p38:g5:u",
    "text": "Yeah, that has to be it!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p38:g3:u",
    "text": "Sasamori-san's definitely qualified!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p38:g2:u",
    "text": "Sorry about earlier!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p38:g4:u",
    "text": "AH UMM..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p38:g1:u",
    "text": "I've got no problem with you doing it!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p39:t0:u",
    "text": "My policy is \"minimal exposure\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p39:g1:u",
    "text": "EH? Mizushima-san..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p39:g2:u",
    "text": "Toru..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p39:g3:u",
    "text": "....! EXCUSE ME FOR A SECOND!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p39:t5:u",
    "text": "Mizushima-san..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p39:t6:u",
    "text": "RISKED ALL THAT ATTENTION FOR ME...!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p40:g1:u",
    "text": "...YOU SHOWED OFF TOO MUCH..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p41:g1:u",
    "text": "AFTER THAT, THE PRESIDENT WAS UNANI- MOUSLY DECIDED UPON."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p41:g4:u",
    "text": "AND SO, MY DAYS OF \"MINIMAL EXPOSURE\"..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p41:g3:u",
    "text": "Good morning, Mizushima-san!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p42:g8:u",
    "text": "'NING."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p42:g7:u",
    "text": "!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p42:g2:u",
    "text": "That's the first time you returned my greeting! I'm so happy!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p42:g5:u",
    "text": "BE QUIET. STAY AWAY FROM ME."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p42:t4:u",
    "text": "左 左"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p42:g4:u",
    "text": "...THAT'S RIGHT. ILL BE HAPPY IF THEY RETURN SOON..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p42:t6:u",
    "text": "太"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p42:g1:u",
    "text": "I MEAN, YOU STAND OUT TOO MUCH."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p42:g6:u",
    "text": "DON'T COME WITHIN 5OM OF ME."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p42:g3:u",
    "text": "Ehehehe, No~"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p43:t0:u",
    "text": "WHY!?"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p43:g1:u",
    "text": "...Mizushima... Toru..."
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p44:t0:u",
    "text": "Mizushima-san! Mizushima-san!"
  },
  {
    "id": "b68ed9e490d577e6:p44:t1:u",
    "text": "PAW"
  }
]
